        "en": "Customers in the physical shop consistently praise the owners and staff members for their helpful, welcoming guidance. Reviewers appreciate that the team provides practical advice on pet care, nutritional needs, and accessories without making shoppers feel rushed. Pet owners describe the in-store team as approachable and genuinely passionate about animals."
