      "text": {
        "en": "Shoppers highlight the clean, well-stocked retail store and its diverse inventory of animal food, treats, and accessories. Multiple clients specifically recommend the shop for bully breeds and French Bulldogs, noting that specialised gear and dietary products are readily available. Visitors frequently praise the convenience of having quality pet provisions in the neighbourhood."
      }
